, and bedside tables with lamps\n✔️ Separate entrances for each unit, from garden level to 2nd upper floor\n✔️ Equipped with WLAN, washer or access to a shared laundry, and ample on-site parking\n✔️ Ideal for professionals, families, or long-term stays seeking tranquility near Hamburg\n\n🛋️ The Apartments\nThese fully furnished apartments in Hittfeld offer functional and comfortable living spaces in a quiet, suburban setting. Each unit comes fully equipped with beds, wardrobes, desks, chairs, and bedside tables with lamps, providing a move-in ready home.\n\nSeparate entrances for each unit ensure privacy and convenience, while WLAN and laundry facilities (washer in each unit or shared laundry) enhance everyday comfort. Ample parking is available on the property.\n\n🏢 Building & Services\nAll apartments were renovated in early 2025 and feature modern, functional furniture and layouts. Each unit is designed for long-term comfort, making it easy to settle in without additional furnishing.\n\n📍 Location\nHittfeld is a charming district of Seevetal with around 5,000 residents, located south of Hamburg. The Hamburg city center is just a few kilometers away, reachable in about 30 minutes via public transport (bus and train).\n\nExcellent road connections via A1, A7, and A39 provide fast access to Hamburg, Lüneburg, and nearby towns like Winsen (Luhe). Local amenities include shops, restaurants, cafés, schools, kindergartens, and medical services.\n\nNature lovers enjoy numerous nearby recreational opportunities, including forests, fields, the Rosengarten state forest, and several local lakes. The idyllic Büsenbachtal offers additional outdoor relaxation and activities, making Hittfeld an attractive location for a balanced lifestyle close to Hamburg.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"y